---
// BOLA (Broken Object Level Authorization / IDOR) Attack vs Defense Diagram Component
---

<figure class="bola-diag" aria-labelledby="bola-diag-caption">
  <!-- Desktop SVG Layout -->
  <svg
    class="bola-diag__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 880 380"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="bola-diag-title bola-diag-desc"
  >
    <title id="bola-diag-title">
      BOLA 失效物件級授權（越權攻擊）vs 縱深防禦機制
    </title>
    <desc id="bola-diag-desc">
      展示攻擊者持有合法 Token 但惡意抽換 URL 中的資源 ID
      存取他人帳單；漏洞伺服器因未檢查擁有者導致越權外洩；而安全伺服器結合 JWT
      Claims 注入與 RLS 行級安全防禦阻斷攻擊。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="bola-arrow-red"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="bola-diag__arrow-head--red"
        ></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="bola-arrow-green"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="bola-diag__arrow-head--green"
        ></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Column 1: Attacker (x: 25, y: 25, width: 230, height: 330) -->
    <g class="bola-diag__card" transform="translate(25, 25)">
      <rect
        width="230"
        height="330"
        rx="10"
        class="bola-diag__card-bg bola-diag__card-bg--attacker"></rect>
      <text class="bola-diag__badge bola-diag__badge--red" x="20" y="28"
        >THREAT ACTOR</text
      >
      <text class="bola-diag__title bola-diag__title--red" x="20" y="52"
        >攻擊者 (User ID: 999)</text
      >

      <g transform="translate(16, 72)">
        <rect width="198" height="74" rx="6" class="bola-diag__subcard"></rect>
        <text class="bola-diag__subcard-title" x="12" y="20"
          >1. 合法登入系統</text
        >
        <text class="bola-diag__subcard-desc" x="12" y="38"
          >• 持有合法頒發的 JWT</text
        >
        <text class="bola-diag__subcard-desc" x="12" y="56"
          >• sub: 999 (身份真實有效)</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(16, 160)">
        <rect
          width="198"
          height="84"
          rx="6"
          class="bola-diag__subcard bola-diag__subcard--alert"></rect>
        <text
          class="bola-diag__subcard-title bola-diag__subcard-title--red"
          x="12"
          y="20">2. 篡改請求目標 ID</text
        >
        <text class="bola-diag__mono-code" x="12" y="42"
          >GET /invoices/10086</text
        >
        <text class="bola-diag__subcard-desc" x="12" y="66"
          >• 10086 為受害者 User 42 帳單</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Red Attack Path to Vulnerable Backend (Top Path) -->
    <path
      d="M 260 115 L 305 115"
      class="bola-diag__line--red"
      marker-end="url(#bola-arrow-red)"></path>

    <!-- Panel 2A: Vulnerable Backend (x: 315, y: 25, width: 540, height: 155) -->
    <g class="bola-diag__card" transform="translate(315, 25)">
      <rect
        width="540"
        height="155"
        rx="10"
        class="bola-diag__card-bg bola-diag__card-bg--red"></rect>
      <text class="bola-diag__badge bola-diag__badge--red" x="20" y="28"
        >VULNERABILITY: BOLA (OWASP API1:2023)</text
      >
      <text class="bola-diag__title bola-diag__title--red" x="20" y="52"
        >❌ 漏洞伺服器：只做 AuthN 認證，遺漏 AuthZ 授權</text
      >

      <g transform="translate(20, 68)">
        <rect
          width="500"
          height="42"
          rx="6"
          class="bola-diag__query-box bola-diag__query-box--bad"></rect>
        <text
          x="250"
          y="26"
          class="bola-diag__query-text--red"
          text-anchor="middle"
        >
          SELECT * FROM invoices WHERE id = 10086;
        </text>
      </g>

      <text class="bola-diag__summary bola-diag__summary--red" x="20" y="136">
        致命缺陷：伺服器未校驗 10086 是否屬於 User 999 ➔ 越權外洩他人帳單隱私！
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Green Defense Path to Secure Backend (Bottom Path) -->
    <path
      d="M 260 275 L 305 275"
      class="bola-diag__line--green"
      marker-end="url(#bola-arrow-green)"></path>

    <!-- Panel 2B: Secure Backend with RLS (x: 315, y: 200, width: 540, height: 155) -->
    <g class="bola-diag__card" transform="translate(315, 200)">
      <rect
        width="540"
        height="155"
        rx="10"
        class="bola-diag__card-bg bola-diag__card-bg--green"></rect>
      <text class="bola-diag__badge bola-diag__badge--green" x="20" y="28"
        >SECURE ARCHITECTURE: RLS &amp; CONTEXT CLAIMS</text
      >
      <text class="bola-diag__title bola-diag__title--green" x="20" y="52"
        >✅ 安全伺服器：強制上下文綁定 + 行級安全策略</text
      >

      <g transform="translate(20, 68)">
        <rect
          width="500"
          height="42"
          rx="6"
          class="bola-diag__query-box bola-diag__query-box--good"></rect>
        <text
          x="250"
          y="26"
          class="bola-diag__query-text--green"
          text-anchor="middle"
        >
          SELECT * FROM invoices WHERE id = 10086 AND user_id = 999;
        </text>
      </g>

      <text class="bola-diag__summary bola-diag__summary--green" x="20" y="136">
        防禦成果：SQL 查無匹配筆數 ➔ 立即回傳 404 Not Found / 403 阻斷越權！
      </text>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile View (Vertical Cards) -->
  <div class="bola-diag__mobile">
    <div class="bola-mobile-card bola-mobile-card--attacker">
      <span class="bola-mobile-badge bola-mobile-badge--red">ATTACK VECTOR</span
      >
      <h4>1. 攻擊者惡意發起請求</h4>
      <p>• 攻擊者（User 999）持有自身合法登入獲得的 JWT Token。</p>
      <p>
        • 呼叫 <code>GET /invoices/10086</code>，試圖窺探受害者（User
        42）的財務隱私。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bola-mobile-arrow">VS. 兩種後端實作</div>

    <div class="bola-mobile-card bola-mobile-card--red">
      <span class="bola-mobile-badge bola-mobile-badge--red"
        >❌ 存在 BOLA 漏洞</span
      >
      <h4>未校驗擁有者歸屬（裸查 ID）</h4>
      <p><code>SELECT * FROM invoices WHERE id = 10086;</code></p>
      <p class="bola-mobile-note">
        伺服器只驗證「Token
        是有效的」，卻未檢查「這張發票是誰的」，直接導致大面積越權資料洩漏。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bola-mobile-card bola-mobile-card--green">
      <span class="bola-mobile-badge bola-mobile-badge--green"
        >✅ 縱深防禦實踐</span
      >
      <h4>注入 Session 上下文與 RLS</h4>
      <p>
        <code>SELECT * FROM invoices WHERE id = 10086 AND user_id = 999;</code>
      </p>
      <p class="bola-mobile-note bola-mobile-note--green">
        強行夾帶 Token 內解析出的 `user_id`
        或啟用資料庫行級安全（RLS），查無資料即刻回傳 404/403！
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="bola-diag-caption" class="bola-diag__caption">
    圖一：BOLA（失效物件級授權 / IDOR）攻擊路徑與行級安全（RLS）防禦架構對比
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bola-diag {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .bola-diag__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .bola-diag__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  .bola-diag__caption {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--dg-muted);
  }

  /* Card Backgrounds */
  .bola-diag__card-bg {
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .bola-diag__card-bg--attacker {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
  }

  .bola-diag__card-bg--red {
    fill: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.03);
    stroke: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.25);
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .bola-diag__card-bg--red {
    fill: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.08);
    stroke: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.35);
  }

  .bola-diag__card-bg--green {
    fill: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.03);
    stroke: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.25);
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .bola-diag__card-bg--green {
    fill: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.08);
    stroke: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.35);
  }

  .bola-diag__badge {
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .bola-diag__badge--red {
    fill: #b91c1c;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .bola-diag__badge--red {
    fill: #fca5a5;
  }

  .bola-diag__badge--green {
    fill: #15803d;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .bola-diag__badge--green {
    fill: #86efac;
  }

  .bola-diag__title {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .bola-diag__title--red {
    fill: #991b1b;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .bola-diag__title--red {
    fill: #f87171;
  }

  .bola-diag__title--green {
    fill: #166534;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .bola-diag__title--green {
    fill: #4ade80;
  }

  /* Subcards */
  .bola-diag__subcard {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  .bola-diag__subcard--alert {
    fill: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.06);
    stroke: #dc2626;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .bola-diag__subcard--alert {
    fill: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.16);
    stroke: #f87171;
  }

  .bola-diag__subcard-title {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }

  .bola-diag__subcard-title--red {
    fill: #b91c1c;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .bola-diag__subcard-title--red {
    fill: #fca5a5;
  }

  .bola-diag__subcard-desc {
    font-size: 11px;
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2);
  }

  .bola-diag__mono-code {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: #b91c1c;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .bola-diag__mono-code {
    fill: #f87171;
  }

  /* Query Boxes */
  .bola-diag__query-box {
    stroke-width: 1.2;
  }

  .bola-diag__query-box--bad {
    fill: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.08);
    stroke: #dc2626;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .bola-diag__query-box--bad {
    fill: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.2);
    stroke: #f87171;
  }

  .bola-diag__query-box--good {
    fill: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.08);
    stroke: #16a34a;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .bola-diag__query-box--good {
    fill: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.2);
    stroke: #4ade80;
  }

  .bola-diag__query-text--red {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: #b91c1c;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .bola-diag__query-text--red {
    fill: #fca5a5;
  }

  .bola-diag__query-text--green {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: #15803d;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .bola-diag__query-text--green {
    fill: #86efac;
  }

  /* Connecting Lines */
  .bola-diag__line--red {
    stroke: #dc2626;
    stroke-width: 2;
    fill: none;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .bola-diag__line--red {
    stroke: #f87171;
  }

  .bola-diag__line--green {
    stroke: #16a34a;
    stroke-width: 2;
    fill: none;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .bola-diag__line--green {
    stroke: #4ade80;
  }

  .bola-diag__arrow-head--red {
    fill: #dc2626;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .bola-diag__arrow-head--red {
    fill: #f87171;
  }

  .bola-diag__arrow-head--green {
    fill: #16a34a;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .bola-diag__arrow-head--green {
    fill: #4ade80;
  }

  .bola-diag__summary {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .bola-diag__summary--red {
    fill: #991b1b;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .bola-diag__summary--red {
    fill: #fca5a5;
  }

  .bola-diag__summary--green {
    fill: #166534;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .bola-diag__summary--green {
    fill: #86efac;
  }

  /* Mobile View */
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .bola-diag__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .bola-diag__mobile {
      display: flex !important;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.875rem;
    }

    .bola-mobile-card {
      background: var(--dg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule);
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      padding: 1rem 1.125rem;
    }

    .bola-mobile-card--attacker {
      background: var(--dg-surface-2);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--dg-rule-strong);
    }

    .bola-mobile-card--red {
      border-left: 4px solid #dc2626;
      background: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.04);
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .bola-mobile-card--red {
      background: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.12);
      border-color: #f87171;
    }

    .bola-mobile-card--green {
      border-left: 4px solid #16a34a;
      background: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.04);
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .bola-mobile-card--green {
      background: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.12);
      border-color: #4ade80;
    }

    .bola-mobile-badge {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    }

    .bola-mobile-badge--red {
      color: #dc2626;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .bola-mobile-badge--red {
      color: #fca5a5;
    }

    .bola-mobile-badge--green {
      color: #16a34a;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .bola-mobile-badge--green {
      color: #86efac;
    }

    .bola-mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.375rem 0;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-ink);
    }

    .bola-mobile-card p {
      margin: 0.2rem 0;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--dg-ink-2);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .bola-mobile-card code {
      font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      background: var(--dg-surface-2);
      padding: 0.1rem 0.3rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    .bola-mobile-note {
      margin-top: 0.5rem !important;
      font-size: 0.8125rem !important;
      color: #991b1b !important;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .bola-mobile-note {
      color: #fca5a5 !important;
    }

    .bola-mobile-note--green {
      color: #15803d !important;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .bola-mobile-note--green {
      color: #86efac !important;
    }

    .bola-mobile-arrow {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-muted);
      padding: 0.125rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>
